          "short": "Sophie is 44 years old.",
          "worked": "Let $x$ be Sophie’s age and $y$ her son’s age, in years.\n$$\\begin{align*}x&=y+24 &&(1)\\\\x+4&=2(y+4) &&(2)\\end{align*}$$\nSub (1) into (2):\n$$\\begin{align*}y+28&=2y+8\\\\y&=20\\\\x&=44\\end{align*}$$\nSophie is 44 years old."
